Duke Weaselton!

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:15.449
Moana
And Raya and the Last Dragon

00:10:15.449 --> 00:10:21.959
He's fast becoming Disney's equivalent to
Pixar's good-luck charm John Ratzenberger.

